#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The B<strfry()> function randomizes the contents of I<string> by using "
#| "B<rand>(3) to randomly swap characters in the string.  The result is an "
#| "anagram of I<string>."
msgid ""
"The B<strfry>()  function randomizes the contents of I<string> by randomly "
"swapping characters in the string.  The result is an anagram of I<string>."
msgstr ""
"La función B<strfry()> mezcla aleatoriamente los caracteres de una cadena "
"cuya dirección se pasa a la función en I<string> mediante llamadas a "
"B<rand>(3) para intercambiar los caracteres aleatoriamente. El resultado es "
"un anagrama de I<string>."

